$MDESC::Type = "CTF Mixed";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Capture the Flag" @
         "\n<f1>Planet: <f0> Omicron Argentis VI" @
         "\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Clear" @
         "\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Night" @ 
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
         "\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> The <vServer::teamName0> and <vServer::teamName1> battle each other on a space station called 1%. This space station is the counter persision to control over a giant planet. This space station was named 100% because it can control the whole planet even if it is not over the certan part of the planet that it wants to control. Your scouts have come back and reported that an enemy ship has landed on the other side of this space station. You must capture there flag 10 time and they have to leave or they will be destroyed by the space station. You must beat them and win the stations power!"@
         "\n\n<f1>Map Made By:<f0> FunGuns"@
         "\n\n<f1>E-mail:<f0> iline@mediaone.net";